senses.gloss:
1. आ-√ 1. वृ P. -वृणोति, to cover, hide, conceal;
to surround, enclose, shut, comprehend, hem in;
to keep off, MBh.; R.; BhP.; Śak.; Kathās. &c.:
Caus. -वारयति, to cover, enclose;
to ward off, keep off, MBh.; R.; BhP.; VarBṛS.

2. आ-√ 2. वृ Ā. (आ॑-वृणे, RV. i, 17, 1, &c.; 1. pl. -वृणीम॑हे) P. (-व॑रत्, RV. i, 143, 6, &c.)
to choose, desire, prefer, RV.; AV.;
to fulfil, grant (a wish), RV.; MBh.

आ-√ वृज् Ā. -वृङ्क्ते (Subj. -व॑र्जते, RV. i, 33, 1; aor. आ॑वृक्त, RV. viii, 90, 16; also P. aor. 1. sg. आ॑वृक्षम्, RV. x, 159, 5)
to turn or bring into the possession of, procure for, bestow, give, RV.;
to turn or bring into one's own possession;
to appropriate, RV.; ŚBr.; BhP.;
to be propitiated, favour, BhP. :
Caus. P. -वर्जयति, to turn over, incline, bend, Hariv.; Śak.; Vikr.; Ragh.; Megh. &c.;
to pour out, Ragh.; Kum.;
to deliver, BhP.; Ragh. &c.;
to cause to yield, overcome;
to gain one's favour, propitiate, attract, Kathās.; Daś. &c.

1. आ-√ वृत् P. (only pf. in RV., -वव॑र्त) Ā. -वर्तते (aor. 3. sg. आ॑वृत्सत, RV. viii, 1, 29; Inf. -वृ॑ते, RV. iii, 42, 3)
to turn or draw round or back or near, RV.; ŚāṅkhŚr.;
to turn or go towards;
to turn round or back, return, revolve, RV.; AV.; VS.; ŚBr.; ChUp.; MBh.; Kathās.; R. &c.:
Caus. P. -वर्तयति (Ved. Subj. -वव॑र्तति Pot. -ववृत्यात्, &c.) Ā. -वर्तयते (Ved. Pot. -ववृतीत, &c.) to cause to turn, roll;
to draw or turn towards;
to lead near or towards;
to bring back;
to turn round or back, RV.; AV.; VS.; TBr.; MBh.; BhP. &c.;
to repeat, recite, say repeatedly;
to pray, ĀśvŚr.; KātyŚr.; Kathās.; R.; Hariv. &c.:
Intens. -वरीवर्त्ति, RV. i, 164, 31; AV. ix, 10, 11, &c., to move quickly or repeatedly.

आ-√ वृष् P. (pf. -ववर्ष) to pour over;
to cover (with arrows), MBh. iv, 1688 :
Ā. -वर्षते, to pour in for one's self, RV.
